@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@adminCookie = YOUR_ADMIN_AUTH_COOKIE

@categoryId = CATEGORY_ID

### create post

POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/blog/create
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{adminCookie}}

{
    "title": "Post API Test", 
    "slug": "post-api-test",
    "excerpt": "e",
    "content": "Open-loop commutation gets a motor spinning, but it teaches you nothing about what the motor is *actually* doing. The moment you ask it to hold a position under load, the illusion breaks.", 
    "coverImageUrl": "https://tse2.mm.bing.net/th/id/OIP.7cRYFyLoDEDh4sRtM73vvwHaDg?r=0&rs=1&pid=ImgDetMain&o=7&rm=3", 
    "category": "{{categoryId}}"
}

### Create a blog category

POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/blog/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{adminCookie}}

{
  "name": "REST Testing",
  "description": "A temporary category used to verify the blog category API.",
  "displayOrder": 99,
  "active": true
}

### List blog categories

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/blog/categories
Accept: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{adminCookie}}

### Include inactive blog categories

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/blog/categories?includeInactive=true
Accept: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{adminCookie}}

### Retrieve a blog category

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/blog/categories/{{categoryId}}
Accept: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{adminCookie}}

### 8. Update a blog category

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/blog/categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{adminCookie}}

{
  "description": "Updated description from the REST Client test.",
  "displayOrder": 100
}

### Reject an attempt to change the category slug

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/blog/categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{adminCookie}}

{
  "slug": "changed-slug"
}

### Deactivate a blog category

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/blog/categories/{{categoryId}}/active
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{adminCookie}}

{
  "active": false
}

### Delete category

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/blog/categories/{{categoryId}}
Cookie: accessToken={{adminCookie}}